[{"title":"柬陈公聘兼怀盛子才 其一","author":"黎民表","text":"聆尔金闺赠，思余白石歌。\n共看杨柳暮，相隔海云多。\n采服依丛桂，高轩映薜萝。\n椒潭风日美，倚棹一经过。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":5301,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"柬陈公聘兼怀盛子才 其二","author":"黎民表","text":"天南归二鸟，俱是凤池群。\n独立青冥外，时来瑞圣君。\n春风摇綵笔，夜月理玄文。\n惆怅初阳洞，相思寄暮云。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":5302,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"挽陈少谦","author":"黎民表","text":"定交怜鲍叔，解剑忆徐君。\n穗帐生秋色，华池入暮云。\n潜夫空有论，封禅竟无文。\n他日山阳笛，重游不可闻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":5303,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"除夕和惟鉴家兄","author":"黎民表","text":"雨色净遥天，华灯照四筵。\n气催残腊日，花发艳阳年。\n冷蕊融残雪，疏枝带暖烟。\n春明好行乐，莫忘棣华篇。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":5304,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"再游西山","author":"黎民表","text":"爽气朝仍在，乘春偶独过。\n雨稀芳桂少，山密夕阳多。\n粤鸟愁燕土，南冠赋楚歌。\n凭轩无限意，流涕满岩阿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":5305,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"出塞曲送陈公聘使边 其二","author":"黎民表","text":"鸣笳发陇首，建节望河源。\n莫以边功重，能令中国尊。\n名王应膜拜，渠帅会宵奔。\n早献安边议，归来入蓟门。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":5306,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过仪真访谭子羽留酌江霞馆因赠 其一","author":"黎民表","text":"榻下高人宅，飞觞夜向分。\n门临扬子渡，窗隔蒋陵云。\n鸾啸因风起，渔歌送客闻。\n江潭无限恨，琼树思氤氲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":5307,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过仪真访谭子羽留酌江霞馆因赠 其二","author":"黎民表","text":"留滞周南久，川程倚棹过。\n江流经楚尽，岭树入吴多。\n兴为悲秋发，情如惜别何。\n津亭明日路，相望隔烟波。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":5308,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"留都 其一","author":"黎民表","text":"钟阜郁岧峣，河山望不遥。\n神宫侵日月，辇路上烟霄。\n弓与龙髯堕，笙随鹤驭飘。\n金凫知不灭，绛节下朝朝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":5309,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"留都 其二","author":"黎民表","text":"六㝢神猷焕，三垓睿览存。\n铸金成九鼎，剪叶建诸藩。\n玉历调元气，琼枝荫本根。\n叨逢中兴日，不改旧乾坤。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":5310,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"留都 其三","author":"黎民表","text":"成龙占王气，游凤记高台。\n山色荆衡尽，江源巴蜀来。\n庙谟资一德，天险仗群材。\n壮观今如此，中流讵足哀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":5311,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"留都 其五","author":"黎民表","text":"紫署招延地，时髦尽逸群。\n镐京陪湛露，韶舞续卿云。\n秀抱江河润，光生草木文。\n菁莪今日化，慷慨忆殊勋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":5312,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"留都 其六","author":"黎民表","text":"伊昔风云际，谁依日月光。\n鹿穷归历数，龙变化侯王。\n俎豆丹青里，江山剑戟傍。\n铅刀思一骋，流恨向宫墙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":5313,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"留都 其七","author":"黎民表","text":"水府荒南国，江津控百蛮。\n登秋来橘柚，踰海贡琅玕。\n岁月龙编远，风烟鸟道寒。\n朝宗真此地，王会万年看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":5314,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登鸡鸣寺 其二","author":"黎民表","text":"驻目凭虚阁，神思迥欲飞。\n雨惊黄叶散，磴绕白云微。\n钟簴千秋在，豪华六代非。\n昙花无住迹，顿染客游衣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":5315,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送李少阶尹嘉兴 其一","author":"黎民表","text":"君向东吴去，幽寻兴不违。\n水田青稻粒，游女绿荷衣。\n问俗纡玄绶，裁诗坐翠微。\n趋朝须及早，莫遣雁南飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":5316,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送李少阶尹嘉兴 其二","author":"黎民表","text":"制锦荣新秩，还乡是昼游。\n彩云辞凤阙，仙盖弥麟洲。\n身系苍生望，符分圣主忧。\n江南民瘼甚，应为达宸旒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":5317,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和子乾游浮丘","author":"黎民表","text":"海上仙山改，人间幻迹留。\n鼎犹烹白石，霞自媚丹丘。\n瑶草期相拾，璇房得并游。\n采芝人不见，惟复桂岩幽。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":5318,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梦中作","author":"黎民表","text":"春殿儆宵钟，千官步辇从。\n中林亲射鹿，瑶水远乘龙。\n柳外笙歌发，花间紫翠重。\n周南留滞久，何日待东封。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":5319,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"瑞雪 其一","author":"黎民表","text":"午夜罄灵祈，千官匝紫微。\n望云车盖合，度曲凤凰飞。\n皎洁随纨扇，凄清炫玉衣。\n侍臣裁郢曲，转觉和人稀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":5320,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"瑞雪 其二","author":"黎民表","text":"瑟密因风度，严城迥不哗。\n入林俱缀叶，妆岫讵成花。\n积气浮琼岛，流云结素华。\n盈车占上瑞，持此报皇家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":5321,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题玉屏墨庄 其一","author":"黎民表","text":"净业临丹壑，高居拥翠屏。\n云光过沼白，山色入池青。\n独鹤将人静，閒门共月扃。\n安知灌园客，不是少微星。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":5322,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题玉屏墨庄 其二","author":"黎民表","text":"兰沼碧沈沈，微风生树林。\n游鱼避荇叶，食鸟下蒲心。\n径狭牵衣袂，岩虚应足音。\n知君数来往，应不倦幽寻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":5323,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题玉屏墨庄 其三","author":"黎民表","text":"陇蜀平分处，风烟迥不迷。\n斜阳褒谷口，古树汉坛西。\n泉石经龙卧，烟萝拂凤栖。\n何时纡俗驾，从尔问丹梯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":5324,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过盛子才馆 其一","author":"黎民表","text":"花林同载酒，幽客重相寻。\n春事连三月，乡愁搅寸心。\n草青临浦尽，云白到江深。\n莫忘还家路，缁尘易见侵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":5325,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过盛子才馆 其二","author":"黎民表","text":"扰扰复依依，閒来此息机。\n一惊春草绿，再见杏花飞。\n楚老怀瑜泣，齐门抱瑟归。\n五陵珠玳美，谁复念牛衣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":5326,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"真州旅馆小楼望江南","author":"黎民表","text":"江皋飞雨至，羁客易潸然。\n稍湿汀前草，微生树杪泉。\n舟行移远岸，帆过宿孤烟。\n偶动乡园念，知忘课秫田。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":5327,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"同行诸公渡江予独留真州","author":"黎民表","text":"飘蓬转岐路，归梦绕丘园。\n落日天边尽，孤云海上翻。\n汀兰看渐歇，径菊别应繁。\n谁念分俦侣，殊方独闭门。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":5328,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"答谭子羽","author":"黎民表","text":"三年书少至，万里兴难乘。\n暂尔忘乖别，从前废寝兴。\n梦回芳草积，愁入夏云蒸。\n待尔金闺去，思予卧茂陵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":5329,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"延清馆小集和子乾","author":"黎民表","text":"蓬径初延赏，空斋独尔思。\n酒深寒夜酌，梅发早春枝。\n浦外流云袅，城闉上月迟。\n莫缘风共雨，长负此幽期。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":5330,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送何郡博迁信宜尹","author":"黎民表","text":"初散槐阴市，还过岭峤东。\n地应邻合浦，人更美文翁。\n县静山容媚，官廉海错丰。\n双凫难久滞，早见入丹枫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":5331,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"长汀李大尹挽词 其一","author":"黎民表","text":"美政推榆次，芳名拟岘山。\n祇闻携鹤去，俄见泣麟还。\n荒垄松楸古，平原橘柚斑。\n夜台埋剑气，犹照斗牛间。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":5332,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"长汀李大尹挽词 其二","author":"黎民表","text":"一从淹建水，无复画麟台。\n学有雕龙辨，人非展骥才。\n茂陵长卧病，栗里竟归来。\n往事穹碑在，松风起暮哀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":5333,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"桐庐道中杂咏 其一","author":"黎民表","text":"宿雨朝来歇，山云尚接连。\n芙蓉乱越渚，粳稻满吴田。\n有景拚为客，无机任似禅。\n乡心虽强制，犹废夜中眠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":5334,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"桐庐道中杂咏 其二","author":"黎民表","text":"结宇荷为盖，编篱槿作扉。\n野晴乾鹊噪，沙暝水禽飞。\n牵路缘青壁，樵歌出翠微。\n滞淫非客意，山水自忘归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":5335,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"桐庐道中杂咏 其三","author":"黎民表","text":"谷口条风改，江中暮霭沈。\n云山招隐兴，京洛倦游心。\n缉芰香盈袂，听猿泪在襟。\n客愁容易老，星鬓莫相侵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":5336,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"桐庐道中杂咏 其四","author":"黎民表","text":"失路人争厌，羁游兴独缄。\n已捐湘水玦，还进赤亭帆。\n水急流纹聚，峰高落日衔。\n青山如可买，来此卧松杉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":5337,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"钓台","author":"黎民表","text":"垂纶人去后，楼阁缅纵横。\n龙卧沧江晚，鸿冥芳草生。\n水犹喧野碓，风自落柴荆。\n物色真虚事，知君不重名。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":5338,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"豫章江行 其一","author":"黎民表","text":"绿筱迷荒岸，清溪下乱流。\n可怜听雨夜，强半为花愁。\n囊已无金错，衣犹拥黑裘。\n翻悲生计拙，不似钓鱼舟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":5339,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"豫章江行 其二","author":"黎民表","text":"千越通津处，青山匝岸多。\n鸥来摇水镜，鸿去避云罗。\n钓■依蒲柳，行舟触芰荷。\n本无浮海志，乘醉且狂歌。","collection":"明","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":5340,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"豫章江行 其三","author":"黎民表","text":"路已经吴越，舟还溯豫章。\n洪涛撞远岸，独鸟下危樯。\n地近长沙湿，山连粤峤长。\n所思非远道，犹复叹殊方。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":5341,"sha256":"ed4816f919